    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/c63ba11c3ce900a5a141adbe82a84aef.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abnormal 1999: Sand Realm is a suspenseful puzzle-solving game. You will play as &quot;An&quot;, who has been exiled by the compass, to uncover the secrets of the exiled land, activate the compass, and escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of exile is like an endless river, taking An to a distant and unfamiliar place. A flame of unyielding spirit burns in An's heart. She knows that sooner or later, either Sam or SU will find her. Until then, An must first find a way to leave this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/0d9b9130d73fd4e5ecdb77c53c4e3999.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Perspective Experience: Freely switch between first-person and third-person perspectives, observe the environment from different angles, and discover hidden clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricately Designed Puzzles: Each puzzle is meticulously crafted, testing both logical thinking and keen observation, bringing you pure puzzle-solving pleasure.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story: As you delve deeper into the journey, you will gradually uncover the secrets behind the exile, experiencing an adventure full of suspense and emotional resonance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere: Exquisite visuals and sound effects create a mysterious and captivating sand world, making you feel as if you are truly there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/1c67199008b492711190138c26c334d1.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a Solo Indie Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, my name is Uncle Q. Welcome to the puzzle game world of QZQ Studio. &quot;The Compass and the Sand&quot; is the sixth installment in the Abnormal 1999 series. I am a passionate solo game developer who has been creating suspenseful puzzle games. My previous works include the &quot;MeiQi&quot; series and the &quot;The Adventures of Lin Shanhai&quot; series. I enjoy what I do, and I am active on social media and in groups. You can find me on Bilibili/Xiaohongshu/Douyin/QQ groups. Feel free to interact with me.<br><br>To learn more about Sand Realm and other puzzle games and benefits from QZQ Studio, you can join the QQ group: 190122625</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abnormal 1999 Series</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game, &quot;The Compass and the Sand&quot;, is the sixth episode of the first season of the Abnormal 1999 series. The previous five episodes are &quot;With in the Obscurity&quot;, &quot;Apartment of Death&quot;, &quot;SU - Unlocking the 4th Dimension&quot;, &quot;Hyperspace&quot;, and &quot;Sector 49&quot;. You can enter the Abnormal 1999 series from any episode in this series, and I will provide a fresh experience in each episode.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/c63ba11c3ce900a5a141adbe82a84aef.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abnormal 1999: Sand Realm is a suspenseful puzzle-solving game. You will play as &quot;An&quot;, who has been exiled by the compass, to uncover the secrets of the exiled land, activate the compass, and escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of exile is like an endless river, taking An to a distant and unfamiliar place. A flame of unyielding spirit burns in An's heart. She knows that sooner or later, either Sam or SU will find her. Until then, An must first find a way to leave this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/0d9b9130d73fd4e5ecdb77c53c4e3999.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Perspective Experience: Freely switch between first-person and third-person perspectives, observe the environment from different angles, and discover hidden clues.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricately Designed Puzzles: Each puzzle is meticulously crafted, testing both logical thinking and keen observation, bringing you pure puzzle-solving pleasure.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gripping Story: As you delve deeper into the journey, you will gradually uncover the secrets behind the exile, experiencing an adventure full of suspense and emotional resonance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Atmosphere: Exquisite visuals and sound effects create a mysterious and captivating sand world, making you feel as if you are truly there.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146640/extras/1c67199008b492711190138c26c334d1.avif?t=1742230521\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by a Solo Indie Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone, my name is Uncle Q. Welcome to the puzzle game world of QZQ Studio. &quot;The Compass and the Sand&quot; is the sixth installment in the Abnormal 1999 series. I am a passionate solo game developer who has been creating suspenseful puzzle games. My previous works include the &quot;MeiQi&quot; series and the &quot;The Adventures of Lin Shanhai&quot; series. I enjoy what I do, and I am active on social media and in groups. You can find me on Bilibili/Xiaohongshu/Douyin/QQ groups. Feel free to interact with me.<br><br>To learn more about Sand Realm and other puzzle games and benefits from QZQ Studio, you can join the QQ group: 190122625</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abnormal 1999 Series</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game, &quot;The Compass and the Sand&quot;, is the sixth episode of the first season of the Abnormal 1999 series. The previous five episodes are &quot;With in the Obscurity&quot;, &quot;Apartment of Death&quot;, &quot;SU - Unlocking the 4th Dimension&quot;, &quot;Hyperspace&quot;, and &quot;Sector 49&quot;. You can enter the Abnormal 1999 series from any episode in this series, and I will provide a fresh experience in each episode.</p>",
    "short_description": "The fate of exile, like an endless river, carries Ann to a distant and unfamiliar land. A flame of unwavering determination burns within Ann's heart. She knows that one day, either Sam or SU will surely find her. Until then, Ann must find a way to escape this place.",
